  "criteria": [
    {
      "source": "mdr",
      "section": "art-51",
      "quote": "Devices shall be divided into classes I, IIa, IIb and III, taking into account the intended purpose of the devices and their inherent risks. Classification shall be carried out in accordance with Annex VIII.",
      "sha256": "8c79563e0606d3fd59bf802c949c325bf16be6b941bb9e07f9d3f85f9bfc13fb",
      "start": 40,
      "end": 247,
      "id": "c-art51"
    },
    {
      "source": "mdr",
      "section": "annex-viii-ch2",
      "quote": "Application of the classification rules shall be governed by the intended purpose of the devices.",
      "sha256": "2a492dd28b44f7046f2eb9dbed3b8af780c9f248ab70ca795472d3106ca8aa5a",
      "start": 35,
      "end": 132,
      "id": "c-3.1"
    },
    {
      "source": "mdr",
      "section": "annex-viii-ch2",
      "quote": "Software, which drives a device or influences the use of a device, shall fall within the same class as the device.",
      "sha256": "2a492dd28b44f7046f2eb9dbed3b8af780c9f248ab70ca795472d3106ca8aa5a",
      "start": 425,
      "end": 539,
      "id": "c-3.3a"
    },
    {
      "source": "mdr",
      "section": "annex-viii-ch2",
      "quote": "If several rules, or if, within the same rule, several sub-rules, apply to the same device based on the device’s intended purpose, the strictest rule and sub-rule resulting in the higher classification shall apply.",
      "sha256": "2a492dd28b44f7046f2eb9dbed3b8af780c9f248ab70ca795472d3106ca8aa5a",
      "start": 825,
      "end": 1039,
      "id": "c-3.5"
    },
    {
      "source": "mdcg-2019-11",
      "section": "sec-4.1",
      "quote": "Therefore, MDSW that both achieves its own intended purpose and also drives or influences the use of a (hardware) device for a medical purpose is classified on its own, based on the intended purpose achieved. In such a case, however, the risk class shall not be lower than the risk class of the hardware medical device.",
      "sha256": "e407811772da9b5b7155eb48781ad81cd8cf614a1ef0ff29fa168c07ce95b04b",
      "start": 913,
      "end": 1232,
      "id": "c-mdcg-floor"
    },
    {
      "source": "com-2025-1023-annexes",
      "section": "annex-i-6",
      "quote": "Section 6.3 is replaced by the following:",
      "sha256": "2e12c6b4311f9cb71d1d449c20a4a5d04130570ebc25ae6fcc2c7e0dde43c78c",
      "start": 2738,
      "end": 2779,
      "id": "p-replace"
    },
    {
      "source": "com-2025-1023-annexes",
      "section": "annex-i-6",
      "quote": "Software which is intended to generate an output that confers a clinical benefit and is used for diagnosis, treatment, prevention, monitoring, prediction, prognosis, compensation or alleviation of a disease or condition is classified as class I, unless the output is intended for a disease or condition:",
      "sha256": "2e12c6b4311f9cb71d1d449c20a4a5d04130570ebc25ae6fcc2c7e0dde43c78c",
      "start": 2792,
      "end": 3095,
      "id": "p-intro"
    },
    {
      "source": "com-2025-1023-annexes",
      "section": "annex-i-6",
      "quote": "in a critical situation with a risk of causing death or an irreversible deterioration of a person’s state of health, in which case it is classified as class III;",
      "sha256": "2e12c6b4311f9cb71d1d449c20a4a5d04130570ebc25ae6fcc2c7e0dde43c78c",
      "start": 3097,
      "end": 3258,
      "id": "p-iii"
    },
    {
      "source": "com-2025-1023-annexes",
      "section": "annex-i-6",
      "quote": "in a serious situation with a risk of causing a serious deterioration of a person’s state of health or a surgical intervention, or to drive clinical management in a critical situation in which cases it is classified as class IIb;",
      "sha256": "2e12c6b4311f9cb71d1d449c20a4a5d04130570ebc25ae6fcc2c7e0dde43c78c",
      "start": 3260,
      "end": 3489,
      "id": "p-iib"
    },
    {
      "source": "com-2025-1023-annexes",
      "section": "annex-i-6",
      "quote": "in a non-serious situation, or to drive clinical management in a serious situation or to inform clinical management in a critical or serious situation in which cases it is classified as class IIa.",
      "sha256": "2e12c6b4311f9cb71d1d449c20a4a5d04130570ebc25ae6fcc2c7e0dde43c78c",
      "start": 3491,
      "end": 3687,
      "id": "p-iia"
    },
    {
      "source": "mdr",
      "section": "annex-viii-rule-13",
      "quote": "All other active devices are classified as class I.",
      "sha256": "327416f68c0e6a20149edbf9370ebe2f5da18268a17878efbfe7cf3a66edbe0e",
      "start": 13,
      "end": 64,
      "id": "c-r13"
    },
    {
      "source": "mdr",
      "section": "art-2",
      "quote": "Software shall also be deemed to be an active device",
      "sha256": "d49b89fe6cae84b2723ab5fad6aa8312aea8e5096c014abd5db62b0073342721",
      "start": 2883,
      "end": 2935,
      "id": "c-active-sw"
    }
  ],
